FDE Academy C4 — course material and platform.

This repository and its contents, including but not limited to session material,
pre-reads, post-reads, notes, transcripts, activity briefs, rubrics, case studies,
question banks, code samples and notebooks, are proprietary and confidential.

GRANT OF ACCESS

Access is granted to enrolled students, instructors and staff of FDE Academy C4 for
the duration of the programme, for the sole purpose of participating in or delivering
it. Enrolled students may use this material for their own learning, including retaining
a personal copy after the programme ends.

